OL,3,GNEWSACouncil scraps plans for #400k
OL,4,Apadel courts
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has scrapped plans for
OL,7,F#436,000 of padel courts after
OL,8,Fidentifying up to 14 privately funded
OL,9,Ffacilities planned across the borough.
OL,11,FBurnley Council announced five months
OL,12,Fago it would build them in Towneley
OL,13,FPark on tennis courts that had fallen
OL,14,Finto disrepair.
OL,16,FCouncil officers said the Lawn Tennis
OL,17,FAssociation had identified significant
OL,18,Funmet demand for padel in Burnley and
OL,19,Fargued that a council-backed facility
OL,20,Fwould help address the shortage.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
